uire; नाभ्यासकममीक्षते Pt. 1. 151.\n—6 To look to, or to investigate, the good or bad luck of any one (with\n dat. of the person); कृष्णाय ईक्षते गर्गः Sk. (शुभाशुभं पर्यालोचयति)\n Bk. 8. 76. ━With {@अधि@} to suspect; सत्येऽप्यपायमधीक्षते H. 4. 102 v. l.\n━{@अन्वव@}\n—1 to see, behold.\n—2 to consider.\n—3 to care for, take into account.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "iksakaH": [{"id": "IkzakaH", "headword": "ईक्षकः", "headword_slp1": "IkzakaH", "fold": "iksakaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-1957", "senses": [{"gloss": "ईक्षकः [ईक्ष्-ण्वुक्ष्] A spectator, beholder.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ईक्षक"], "synonyms_slp1": ["Ikzaka"]}], "iksaRam": [{"id": "IkzaRam", "headword": "ईक्षणम्", "headword_slp1": "IkzaRam", "fold": "iksaRam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-1957", "senses": [{"gloss": "ईक्षणम् [ईक्ष्-ल्युट्]\n—1 Seeing, beholding &c.\n—2 A look, sight, aspect, view.\n—3 An eye; अश्रुपूर्णाकुलेक्षणम् Bg. 2. 1. इत्यद्रिशोभाप्रहितेक्षणेन\n R. 2. 27; so अलसेक्षणा.\n—4 Regarding, looking after, caring for.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "iksaRasravas": [{"id": "IkzaRaSravas", "headword": "ईक्षणश्रवस्", "headword_slp1": "IkzaRaSravas", "fold": "iksaRasravas", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-1957", "senses": [{"gloss": "ईक्षणम् + .{@-श्रवस्@} m. A serpent; एषा नो नैष्ठिकी बुद्धिः सर्वेषामीक्षणश्रवः Mb. 1. 37. 29.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "iksaRikaH": [{"id": "IkzaRikaH", "headword": "ईक्षणिकः", "headword_slp1": "IkzaRikaH", "fold": "iksaRikaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-1957", "senses": [{"gloss": "ईक्षणिकः [ईक्षण-ठन्] A fortune-teller; मङ्गलादेशवृत्ताश्च\n भद्राश्चेक्षाणिकैः सह Ms. 9. 258.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ईक्षणिक"], "synonyms_slp1": ["IkzaRika"]}], "iksaRika": [{"id": "IkzaRikA", "headword": "ईक्षणिका", "headword_slp1": "IkzaRikA", "fold": "iksaRika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-1957", "senses": [{"gloss": "ईक्षणिकः + .{@-का@} A female fortune-teller.", "g